  - Guid: 4565c7fe-e6bb-4f22-b479-20b8ca35a011
    ActorName: David
    GroupName: 
    Type: 1
    Text: Being a dispatcher is pretty simple, really. Just wait for the calls to come in and answer the phone.
    EventID: 
    position: {x: 1798, y: -277}
    PropertyType: 
    PropertyBooleanValue: 0
    PropertyIntValue: 0
    PropertyName: 
    IncrementAmount: 0
    ComparisonType: 0
    ComparsionCondition: 0
    CameraFromLocationTag: 
    CameraToLocationTag: 
    CameraLookAtTag: 
    Duration: 0
    Choices:
    - Text: 
      Next: 8d7e7d6a-2ae0-425e-8c12-ea8ba1099def
  - Guid: 8d7e7d6a-2ae0-425e-8c12-ea8ba1099def
    ActorName: David
    GroupName: 
    Type: 1
    Text: Try to get the caller's address and as much information as you can about the situation. Then, assign the appropriate units to the call.
    EventID: 
    position: {x: 2135, y: -445}
    PropertyType: 
    PropertyBooleanValue: 0
    PropertyIntValue: 0
    PropertyName: 
    IncrementAmount: 0
    ComparisonType: 0
    ComparsionCondition: 0
    CameraFromLocationTag: 
    CameraToLocationTag: 
    CameraLookAtTag: 
    Duration: 0
    Choices:
    - Text: 
      Next: d5afe3e7-8e00-47dc-90a6-86c26625396b
  - Guid: d5afe3e7-8e00-47dc-90a6-86c26625396b
    ActorName: David
    GroupName: 
    Type: 1
    Text: Remember, police handle crimes, EMS handles medical emergencies, and fire... well, I think you can figure that one out. Rescue squad handles traffic accidents and other technical rescues.
    EventID: 
    position: {x: 2496, y: -446}
    PropertyType: 
    PropertyBooleanValue: 0
    PropertyIntValue: 0
    PropertyName: 
    IncrementAmount: 0
    ComparisonType: 0
    ComparsionCondition: 0
    CameraFromLocationTag: 
    CameraToLocationTag: 
    CameraLookAtTag: 
    Duration: 0
    Choices:
    - Text: 
      Next: 72be6a0c-824a-4760-8740-e4447016fa87
  - Guid: 72be6a0c-824a-4760-8740-e4447016fa87
    ActorName: David
    GroupName: 
    Type: 1
    Text: ' Pretty straightforward, right? Just try not to send the fire department to a cat stuck in a tree. '
    EventID: 
    position: {x: 2860, y: -448}
    PropertyType: 
    PropertyBooleanValue: 0
    PropertyIntValue: 0
    PropertyName: 
    IncrementAmount: 0
    ComparisonType: 0
    ComparsionCondition: 0
    CameraFromLocationTag: 
    CameraToLocationTag: 
    CameraLookAtTag: 
    Duration: 0
    Choices:
    - Text: 
      Next: d4d172f4-ec8a-4d69-9a12-008c200e41fe
  - Guid: d4d172f4-ec8a-4d69-9a12-008c200e41fe
    ActorName: David
    GroupName: 
    Type: 1
    Text: Actually, no, they probably get those calls too.
    EventID: 
